This directory distributes standalone HLS algorithm adapters and their tests.
The board-specific DMA shell, register RTL, constraints, shell patches,
implementation scripts and shell simulations are maintained in a separate
private project and are not distributed or licensed by this repository.
The repository's MIT license applies to the original HLS adapter code here;
it grants no rights to external board designs, gzip IP or vendor tools.

The LZ4/Zstd HLS adapters include the Xilinx Vitis Data Compression Library, licensed
under Apache-2.0. That library is an external build dependency and is not
relicensed under MIT. Preserve its license and notices in distributed IP.
